{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1350,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:175b8c8f1c0dd39ecc91be13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去海边玩玩也不错啊。\r\n不过以我的性子来说，比起沙滩，\r\n我还是更喜欢在码头乱逛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c74a99efd5125fd0931e5a952279450657f42a777e806af95dafc474287af9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a71a46e5976aaf2d7c1cc0ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "常去的店家在叫我去吃当季的胡萝卜。\r\n嘛，毕竟一年一度的秋天嘛。\r\n你陪我一起去吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e9612fad2573db7785d7d507bc46ffc2f0a2c8e9f4f9531cdb8e295d54b66d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2d601583e658a89fb8b69a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经到这么冷的时候了，\r\n还是躲被炉里边吧……\r\n在桌上也玩些刺激的对局吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b15e9230c3c2561a6048e296d0a6456b0791114be8440f7ba2f33b8129b361f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73b6c8ffe4567b6ed9868cbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，开干吧。\r\n在决胜负的那刻到来前，\r\n可不能让心中的火苗熄灭啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eec3b398b6ebc97f62acb5015af9badb967b489d8d103421fcbdc4d0e57ddcc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:462e50e61d2d7d9ee9150e20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "決める……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f251105ac4b22e6f4ee5359e1b9ebf1ec2267ed2e0efaaf1ee82cb16be2a8d87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fe6bd27dfcc495c0d066c56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了能真正获得“已经赌上了一切”\r\n的实感，我还得努力才行啊。\r\n今天也拜托你了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fc801108875e78ccc33de3c4a5f9c0bf30a3fcc7c57c6dfa2d4b596d58a0066",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0febfbe7839dcc0b7e624295",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若是不做好准备的话，\r\n打从一开始便注定是场无趣的赌局。\r\n好了，打起精神开干吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bf33bf2630d3cf1407b6c0906d5415aeec6533791c906636e7c34b6a1cdb32f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6e8526ebf2d83164969d937",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体逐渐暖和起来了，\r\n内心的火焰也开始熊熊燃烧了啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44e844a8e64cdb8ed8aed23e9d34803eeff439f43203806f8ab01eade29adc13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:976089124a5aab98a9c2eec2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你应该能懂我意思的吧？\r\n绝不妥协——\r\n就拜托你安排点更严苛的训练啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a57124d6940c51f8f511453849be83eecc67cd951e4f5b706349d7d458c03c91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5abe40b56203f01cca85f464",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也沉醉于这样汗毛倒竖的感觉了吧？\r\n……我懂的，的确很爽啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d761ddaf38db5dbf79ee00076458e5ddd07e0aa85f1405a5335328f0592d3472",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c116296351283c3bf77ece88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有人能陪我一起把那群大白痴\r\n耍得团团转的感觉也不错啊……\r\n以后就指望你了哦，搭档。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5414aec8953629477a26d5ba35793e4fe6b70c0fcf48da02866244f0e0c379b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26c9516d766f136f399149b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚下是阻碍前行的砂尘，头顶是\r\n蒸发体力的太阳……真是了不得的\r\n修罗场啊，我都开始感兴趣了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f306f6c6a95f950383bb79a4e2ac892563cc2934e00f882bf8b93a60769f5a89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1360589d25b475e19b702e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咱们互相选作搭档……\r\n对彼此都是大好事啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "218599142bd2d69ce4e3279b83b9e529b3b57694bbc435f3f6daf3ab21871fca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c88293143910c23325bbed24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这可是尽情地耍了一回蠢劲儿啊……\r\n这下可舒服啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48e1d71ab4d767c4b1bce1731c59103b3b75d0b9fcd7d6b7d0b5090b00b04d8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3d75a9f22b894fb56cd6288",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这可是赛场啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cac6ac8248ae0dcbef58f146cbeeb09ef6888cb90096ee489ea55468e555547c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9363140fb8292cd4ba17646",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧——\r\n朝着未曾谋面的大舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "463132294f9ae4bb11fc26a01b13734dcc2110defadf8e2f46ef886ee6d97fa6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dea3abb2a61815b200cbe1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是中山庆典。嘛，有劳你啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6ffdc76eaa510092e6b053a966664715745ba5c8a7f54110e7efdc1570fe148",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65fc19a6a296e94b85f437f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将“生命”的一切闪耀于这一瞬间。\r\n这就是我的毕生所求……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7ee65dcb84550916dc9446d2cb34dc895bf7c2392bf89bbb02b1666b3d354a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9207dfbca221db227e315111",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我再展示些独门绝技吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9acabc151c6ad65faa8306d05757b71b700481df646bab51c6b6454b5a7925c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:153c7dce57d8d29fc7f3a3c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我越过这这堵高墙吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "95696d29ad6c6d6c6aa0c28ad87f71784c59a440720fa5ba591046ce07fd8a96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9ffbc6b3972a234512c44f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……差不多该走了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "130bd2d0e4736912fb2647ca6ec2b940d3a610963c9e06ad09a09e9a8ab4aefc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f29decede8ec8d10bfeb257a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "末脚就是我最大的武器什么的，\n过去从没人这样对我说过。\n……注意到这一点的， 只有你而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d49d97562e583f6cb5dc920bbcd2eb2f6be376ea48cfda042680c731ef26b8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c064a4b52f43e0af096340df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c258c6fbb37905535703e68e2fc288861a7a636980f7eab0cb36dd332608f75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09b63671560f1c355fc45796",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:972f08dd38a395a4a372b338",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要是有了孩子的话……\n肯定会被那孩子讨厌的吧。\n毕竟你又热血又麻烦又爱瞎担心……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dfebc76cead7b9ec0dd398d74748fc47d204330e7f3ebe358c2809296c86247",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6d1bb58a6320a167af9a25a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要是能像水族馆的鱼一样，\n一直老老实实待着就好了。\n……不过，那样也不像你了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dbcf1de4a665f6da316dfb5e86a003c632437551b0f2d4fb250a35414ed3591",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0eb048e9b1890f68b5fbc555",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总觉得……\n新的一年你也没有丝毫变化啊。\n…不过，算了。请多指教。",
      "source_fingerprint": "977b1ea051c9c16c430379695ea3aacc6a5cd23ef96bb61c1c9cd7f339ae3059",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70517b6612c6833999a122fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做友情巧克力可真麻烦…\r\n嗯？你看什么呢？\r\n难不成你也想要？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6512955cd7dbcd99413b8da4ef1d5cd74c10b5dc56ad302896f4129d9cc70c9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57c99b4a5c772a07044ebdab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊………等会给你个巧克力。\r\n你问什么巧克力？情人节的啊。\r\n毕竟也受了你不少照顾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23bf8ec13c75d42943ea4fa366241f2b6d485d1116eef3b8f783d6993bc42703",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c0b56cbf72d7d3a65d2329f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "短册吗……\n我的愿望是打算亲手实现的，不需要上天的帮助。\n不过你想写什么倒是随便你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "836ba9e58a873f593f031cae4439b5d373e1c166341bb55cba7d3700b13051b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50ede805896b6358e61e50cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去买点万圣节用的糖吧……\n反正那帮吵死人的家伙肯定会跑来找我的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd3a3e0dd0c859a76990105dfb7e26a92ba6f0bfb691fadcf45fe5aeb5260bc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d50cd9cd93224c54d4d442e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要圣诞老人送什么礼物……？\n……我早就过了那个年纪了。\n你别把我当小孩啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58cd5cd3ebfbf0cb1b4c45271149d762d2ba5ad0046481e034a4cba856e7b47d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b362e84711418dc1ad127d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我只是讨厌吵闹的地方，\n圣诞节本身倒不怎么讨厌。\n……毕竟圣诞的街景蛮漂亮的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d2d783625f43fd1ae7f98166e0b843dbf5c09772df381ba4f57c46b095bfa1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05a2b5f867046c0964a77b28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼……看见了吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74f75fe03a719748932e15f924d70aa5ddc9da0c03e3870b34439efcdd95ffa8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88147ca8b6c6be84706f7a82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不少人回了老家，赛道空出来了啊。\n那就让我跑个痛快吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d9d1afbeb6e6821cfa405c6b7450612685014b755a6ed815cb8a4c242f6a0e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b2b319ab6078d90acbda418",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你今天过生日对吧。\n……生……生日快乐什么的……\n你就别指望我说了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16d93a3ac0b9fc78e694eb35de8a6eb46628b85897a26571670b8797eaf893d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c21fa543eec7318064d9a85b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快……喂，你那表情什么意思啊。\n看上去好蠢……\n哈哈……这表情挺逗的啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "433e36ef9e7c4d7d3b7b1de84e693f8339c99b9bdb60632f4507cafcf68db520",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9a8f577aa6fab5b7b1322a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶，我的生日？\n……这种事情你都记得一清二楚啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "977688630b3a471f1fc911f5a6bae5721e32c53e04e861bc64eff390a7f61040",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:329d0835c76aa48581cba97b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日？啊啊，嗯。谢谢。\n………怎么了?\n我不大习惯被人道贺，所以愣了一下而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9dfa6514781ba3c687b5a07f884852de91d4d10df3bd7c0ee3a39f65835fd6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39b2ec5360bce7608367f06a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有通知啊。\n你要看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbf74a9a87dbb818bc0211f8045f9ec19aa49fb2848c347f19c15105abe9c696",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16fc6d671efa36ae7c691f23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有送给你的礼物啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f46ad879cf48536790e63e535f2218b336e1fabb83c6d9a5a3d4021f721047ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe27b90c4e31e13679c25f3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你完成了什么任务啊。\r\n应该有什么奖励，去看一眼吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58ceb9ded3c732eee1d6b149b116a761701729ceb83be674f87ec1ac33844f0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d85f4b07fb4728e226e80b8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动好像要开始了……\n不过我不大清楚就是了。",
